From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:02:03 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 181/297] Meridian: Claude Code started by hand in a Workbench
 shell tab reports too

A shell tab's zsh gets Meridian's startup files (ZDOTDIR): the person's own
run first, then `claude` typed there (their alias or function included)
gets Meridian's --settings and browser tools. Mission Control keeps a hidden
session for the tab that shows once Claude Code starts and hides again when
it ends; the guard and permission card work there too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
